{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW LOADING...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long are you willing to wait for loading?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW LOADING SIMULATOR is a game where you keep waiting until the loading reaches 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have nothing else to do, just start up this game and wait until it reaches 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it reaches 100%, you will surely feel a great sense of accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there anything else you need to do besides gaming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If that happens, quit the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next time you resume the game, it will start from 0%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements are also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell us how you felt when you reached 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Live streaming OK (YouTube , Twitch...) (no contact required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* If you are going to do live streaming, please include as much of the following information as possible.(Not necessary if there is no space to write it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame title</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSteam store page URL</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678580?t=1746836859","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3678580?t=1746836859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678580/c813691614c0c3edde8c762d6823ee4d6121a2ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746836859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678580/c813691614c0c3edde8c762d6823ee4d6121a2ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746836859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW LOADING...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long are you willing to wait for loading?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOW LOADING SIMULATOR is a game where you keep waiting until the loading reaches 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will test your patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have nothing else to do, just start up this game and wait until it reaches 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have to do is wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once it reaches 100%, you will surely feel a great sense of accomplishment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there anything else you need to do besides gaming?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If that happens, quit the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The next time you resume the game, it will start from 0%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements are also available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tell us how you felt when you reached 100%.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Live streaming OK (YouTube , Twitch...) (no contact required)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* If you are going to do live streaming, please include as much of the following information as possible.(Not necessary if there is no space to write it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame title</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSteam store page URL</p>","developers":["Team NOW LOADING"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3678580/b9bcc57a8adfbca044232e58cbbfef3bbe00a926/header.jpg?t=1746836859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.